      "source": "<code>HttpExchangeAdapterDecorator</code> that suppresses the\n<a href=\"../../../client/HttpClientErrorException.NotFound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>HttpClientErrorException.NotFound</code></a> exception raised on a 404 response\nand returns a <code>ResponseEntity</code> with the status set to\n<a href=\"../../../../http/HttpStatus.html#NOT_FOUND\"><code>HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND</code></a> status, or\n<code>null</code> from <a href=\"../../../client/support/NotFoundRestClientAdapterDecorator.html#exchangeForBody(org.springframework.web.service.invoker.HttpRequestValues,org.springframework.core.ParameterizedTypeReference)\"><code>NotFoundRestClientAdapterDecorator.exchangeForBody(HttpRequestValues, ParameterizedTypeReference)</code></a>.",
